account.description:
Reading the balance requires a signed-in session. This integration uses the official Towngas WeChat authorization and never stores your password.

1. Scan the QR code below with **WeChat on your phone**;
2. After authorizing, the page redirects to `{oauth_redirect}`;
3. Copy the value after `authCode=` from the redirect URL into field 4.

{oauth_qr_markdown}

> If the QR code is not shown, open `{qr_url}` in this browser instead, or copy the link from field 1 and open it with WeChat on your phone.

**Where each value comes from:**
- field 2 **subsCode**: last part of the billing URL (e.g. .../ZS0105/1700075442 -> 1700075442)
- field 3 **subsId**: log in at www.towngasvcc.com/?login=true (phone + SMS), then open www.towngasvcc.com/user/querySubsList and copy the 32 character subsId
- field 4 **authCode**: the value after `authCode=` in the redirect URL (valid ~5 minutes)

{error_detail}

reauth_confirm.description:
The session for subscriber {subs_code} has expired, please authorize again:

1. Scan the QR code below with **WeChat on your phone** (if it is not shown, open `{qr_url}` in this browser);
2. Copy the value after `authCode=` from the redirect URL into field 4.

{oauth_qr_markdown}

{error_detail}
